invariant: INV-36
file: build.zig
catches: test/zig-build-check.sh
reason: build.zig stops telling a device client from a host product, so a
  Zig build of the default raw client on an arm64 or x86-64 target
  compiles the host object, which make lib does not. test/zig-build-check.sh
  compares the two builds' defines for the default configuration and
  fails on -DCH_CPU_RUNTIME.

--- old
    const host = hostTarget(target) and !deviceClient(config);
--- new
    const host = hostTarget(target);
